1
00:00:02,978 --> 00:00:05,676
OK, Richard. That's terrific.

2
00:00:05,676 --> 00:00:09,678
Your pressure is 120 over 75, and that's fine.

3
00:00:09,678 --> 00:00:21,354
Now stand up, please.

4
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:26,237
Good, it's 122 over 80.

5
00:00:26,237 --> 00:00:31,019
You can sit down now.

6
00:00:31,019 --> 00:00:33,881
When was your last complete physical?

7
00:00:33,881 --> 00:00:35,307
Six months ago.

8
00:00:35,307 --> 00:00:37,595
Good. Do you have any back or knee problems?

9
00:00:37,595 --> 00:00:40,437
Nope. I am in perfect health.

10
00:00:40,437 --> 00:00:42,120
What do you do for a living, Mr. Stewart?

11
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,515
I'm a photographer.

12
00:00:43,515 --> 00:00:45,978
Interesting. What do you photograph?

13
00:00:45,978 --> 00:00:51,795
Everything. The American scene. People, places, events.

14
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:56,012
Did you ever think of photographing an aerobics class?

15
00:00:56,012 --> 00:01:00,968
No...I can't remember taking pictures of people exercising.

16
00:01:00,968 --> 00:01:02,876
But don't you think it'd be a good subject?

17
00:01:02,876 --> 00:01:06,713
Sure.

18
00:01:06,713 --> 00:01:09,812
I need some good photos for my advertising, Mr. Stewart.

19
00:01:09,812 --> 00:01:11,423
Maybe you can photogragh a class,

20
00:01:11,423 --> 00:01:13,464
and I can give you and Mrs.Stewart

21
00:01:13,464 --> 00:01:15,311
a month of classes ree.

22
00:01:15,311 --> 00:01:16,973
When can I photograph a class?

23
00:01:16,973 --> 00:01:19,056
Anytime.

24
00:01:19,056 --> 00:01:20,103
How about today?

25
00:01:20,103 --> 00:01:23,724
Terrific!

26
00:01:23,724 --> 00:01:26,074
Hi.

27
00:01:26,074 --> 00:01:30,486
Oh, hi.

28
00:01:30,486 --> 00:01:30,927
Are we ready to go?

29
00:01:30,927 --> 00:01:31,491
Yeah. Yeah. Let's get in our lines.

30
00:01:31,491 --> 00:01:35,246
We're going to take it slow first.

31
00:01:35,246 --> 00:01:37,185
Stretch up...and we're going to go left first ...

32
00:01:37,185 --> 00:01:50,328
2,3,4 ... now switch. ...

33
00:01:50,328 --> 00:01:52,257
OK, hold to the right.

34
00:01:52,257 --> 00:02:00,845
Sunrises. Stretch it out. Flat back.

35
00:02:00,845 --> 00:02:15,137
Bring it up ... and twists ... and side ... 2, 3 ...

36
00:02:15,137 --> 00:02:23,879
and left ... push ... push ... turn ... hit the floor.

37
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:39,341
Take it side again .... OK, and switch. Stretch it out.

38
00:02:39,341 --> 00:02:42,747
And we're going to warm down with a tango.

39
00:02:42,747 --> 00:03:00,979
Left, right. Enjoy it.

40
00:03:00,979 --> 00:03:03,739
Richard, did you go to the Davis Aerobics class today?

41
00:03:03,739 --> 00:03:09,484
Yes, I went to the aerobics class today.

42
00:03:09,484 --> 00:03:12,532
What is wrong with you?

43
00:03:12,532 --> 00:03:15,199
Nothing. I am in excellent health.

44
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:18,585
I have ideal blood pressure. A perfect heart.

45
00:03:18,585 --> 00:03:23,571
In other words, I'm in wonderful condition.

46
00:03:23,571 --> 00:03:26,434
Richard, did you go to the aerobics class, really?

47
00:03:26,434 --> 00:03:30,620
And don't forget to invite Susan for dinner.

48
00:03:30,620 --> 00:03:32,323
And your legs don't hurt?

49
00:03:32,323 --> 00:03:36,222
Hurt? What do you mean?

50
00:03:36,222 --> 00:03:40,726
What about your arms? Lift your arms up like this.

51
00:03:40,726 --> 00:03:44,543
And they don't hurt ot even a little?

52
00:03:44,543 --> 00:03:48,965
Nope.

53
00:03:48,965 --> 00:03:48,965
You are in great condition. I can't believe it!
